() '
(Acme Robotics Travel and Expense Policy) '
() '
(This policy explains which business expenses Acme Robotics reimburses and how to claim) '
(them. Acme Robotics is a fictional company used for demos.) '
() '
() '
(1. Submitting Expenses) '
() '
(Expenses must be submitted in the expense tool within 30 days of the purchase. Claims) '
(submitted later than 90 days after the purchase are not reimbursed.) '
() '
(A receipt is required for every expense above 25 EUR. For smaller amounts a short) '
(description is sufficient. Reimbursements are paid with the next monthly salary.) '
() '
() '
(2. Approval) '
() '
(Expenses up to 500 EUR are approved by your manager. Expenses above 500 EUR additionally) '
(require approval from the department head. Any single expense above 5,000 EUR must be) '
(approved by the finance team before the purchase.) '
() '
ET
endstream
endobj
