() '
(3. Business Travel) '
() '
(Book flights and hotels through the company travel portal. Economy class is the standard) '
(for all flights. Business class is allowed only for flights longer than 6 hours and must) '
(be approved in advance by the department head.) '
() '
(Train travel is preferred for trips shorter than 4 hours. First-class train tickets are) '
(allowed for trips longer than 2 hours.) '
() '
(Hotel costs are reimbursed up to 150 EUR per night in most cities and up to 220 EUR per) '
(night in London, Paris, New York and Tokyo.) '
() '
() '
(4. Meals) '
() '
(Meal expenses during business travel are reimbursed up to 50 EUR per day for domestic) '
(travel and up to 75 EUR per day for international travel. Alcohol is not reimbursed,) '
(except at client dinners approved by your manager.) '
() '
ET
endstream
endobj
