() '
(5. Mileage) '
() '
(Employees who use their private car for business trips receive 0.30 EUR per kilometre.) '
(Commuting between home and the office is not a business trip and is not reimbursed.) '
() '
() '
(6. Non-reimbursable Expenses) '
() '
(The following are never reimbursed: traffic and parking fines, personal entertainment such) '
(as films in hotels, minibar items, and lost personal belongings.) '
() '
() '
(7. Corporate Cards) '
() '
(Employees who travel more than four times per year can request a corporate credit card) '
(from the finance team. Corporate cards must not be used for personal purchases. Monthly) '
(statements must be reconciled within 10 days.) '
() '
ET
endstream
